iLOOM 1.0 Development Comments:
-------------------------------

This version is under construction. Sorry, temporary comment in english only.
The beta version if destributed will not have this new function enabled.

NEW! In the final version 3.00 you will be able to create totally as you wish
menus. This will include:

        # virtually unlimited page length and width
        # totally parametrable displacement of any name of config
        # totally parametrable choice zone defines
        # totally parametrable external text, including ANSI support for
          background, foreground, parts or choices.
        # totally transparent switch between the new and the old lists mode.
        # full functionality off all options of the old-style list of
          configurations
        # animations during moves or idle waits
        # external program to create the new-style lists
        # etc...

If you didn't understand a word, this means that you will be able to make
your list of confugrations as you like! Putting an ANSI in background,
commenting the choices or whatever.

The next generation will implement the graphics mode, probably JPEG and GIF
support, maybe idle 3D animations.

 iLOOM (c) is the property and has been created and written for AUTOCONF by
                     Serge Huber epflCH - 1995
              Implementation is now under construction.

...ask yourself a question: Is there anything AUTOCONF can't do?

